  "description": "Lee Ru-Han, who cares about nothing but money, has made escaping his semi-basement apartment his life’s greatest goal. One day, he receives an unexpected offer from his older sister: if he temporarily takes care of a chameleon for two weeks, she’ll cover his moving expenses. The night after taking in this unwelcome creature, Ru-Han wakes up from the intense heat to find a huge, unfamiliar man standing right in front of him... \n\nNo way... Could that giant spouting nonsense right in front of me actually be that chameleon?! \n\n *“Master, it’s really hot down here. I want to get inside you, Ru-Han...”*\n\n(Source: MrBlue, translated)",
